# AI coding agents — local session state, caches and machine-specific settings.
# Shared instruction files (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .github/copilot-instructions.md) are
# deliberately NOT ignored: those belong to the repository. Only their *.local.* variants
# and the agents' own working directories do. If a shared .claude/ config is added later
# (e.g. .claude/skills/), un-ignore it explicitly with a !-rule.
.claude/
.superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.continue/
.gemini/
.roo/
.cline/
.opencode/
.serena/
.specstory/
.aider*
.codeium/
*.local.md
**/settings.local.json

# Generated by license-maven-plugin (add-third-party) during generate-resources, since #249
# into target/generated-resources/license/, and shipped in the bundle under META-INF/. Every
# build therefore ships a freshly generated copy, so committing it added no compliance value -
# only drift: Dependabot bumps changed the resolved versions without regenerating the file,
# which broke CI on every dependency PR. Builds before #249 wrote it into the project root;
# kept ignored there so that such a stale copy is not committed by accident.
THIRD-PARTY.txt
